                                        <small class="text-muted text-uppercase fw-bold d-block" style="font-size:.7rem">Petitioner / Appellant</small>
                                        <div class="fw-bold text-dark" id="live_petitioner_corp_wp" style="word-break: break-word;">
                                            The Managing Director, NWKRTC
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
